    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>AURA</strong> strong transmutation; <strong>CL</strong> 15th <strong>SLOT</strong> —; <strong>PRICE</strong> 35,000 gp; <strong>WEIGHT</strong> —</p>\n<p><strong>DESCRIPTION</strong><br>\nThis item functions as a motif bauble, save that the the user may benefit from this item’s motif as well as any motifs he possesses from his class or other Motif Baubles.</p>\n<p><strong>CONSTRUCTION REQUIREMENTS</strong><br>\nCraft Wondrous item, limited wish, Creator must be a henshin hero or magical girl; <strong>COST</strong> 30,000 gp.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/gonzo-wondrous-items#toc9\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
